# Line endings pinned ONLY for files that break on Linux when they arrive CRLF
# from a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true): bash scripts, systemd units and
# nginx configs. Deliberately narrow - a repo-wide `* text=auto eol=lf` would
# renormalise every tracked file (production-cicd-readiness D9, task 7.4).
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.conf    text eol=lf
scripts/git-hooks/* text eol=lf
